# User Config

All user-specific values for the recruiting skills. New users: fill this out and all skills will pick it up.

## Hiring Manager

| Key               | Value                                          |
| ----------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |
| Name              | Your Name                                      |
| First name        | Your First Name                                |
| Email             | you@yourcompany.com                            |
| Zoom link         | https://zoom.us/my/your-zoom-link              |
| Office address    | 335 Pioneer Way, Mountain View, CA 94041       |
| Office short name | Mountain View                                  |
| Timezone          | America/Los_Angeles                            |

## Slack

| Key                 | Value                                    |
| ------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |
| Channel             | #recruit-bot                             |
| Channel ID          | your-channel-id                          |
| User ID             | your-slack-user-id                       |
| Copilot bot user ID | your-bot-user-id                         |
| Copilot bot token   | Read from `CLAUDE.local.md` (gitignored) |

## Ashby

| Key                         | Value                  |
| --------------------------- | ---------------------- |
| User ID                     | your-ashby-user-id     |
| Feedback form definition ID | your-feedback-form-id  |

## Interviewers

Team members who conduct interviews. Used by scheduling and reply skills to CC the right people.

| Name           | Email                     | Role                  |
| -------------- | ------------------------- | --------------------- |
| Jane Smith     | jane@yourcompany.com      | Technical interview   |
| John Doe       | john@yourcompany.com      | Hiring manager        |

## Known Noise Senders

Exclude these from inbox checks — they never contain candidate-relevant content.

```
theathletic.com
noreply@modeanalytics.com
no-reply@github.com
hello@frontapp.com
lyftmail.com
uber.com
```
